### Tawasol CRM - Deal Pipeline Management API Tests
### Testing Deal CRUD operations, pipeline stages, filters, and statistics

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@acmeSubdomain = acme.tawasol.com
@techstartSubdomain = techstart.tawasol.com

### ============================================================
### 1. Setup - Login to Acme tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Host: {{acmeSubdomain}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@acme.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
# Save token from response
@acmeToken = {{1. Setup - Login to Acme tenant.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 2. Setup - Login to TechStart tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Host: {{techstartSubdomain}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah.wilson@techstart.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
@techstartToken = {{2. Setup - Login to TechStart tenant.response.body.token}}

### ============================================================
### 3. Create Deal - Enterprise Software Deal (Acme)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deals
Host: {{acmeSubdomain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Enterprise CRM Implementation",
  "value": 150000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "stage": "QUALIFIED",
  "probability": 25,
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "source": "Referral",
  "description": "Complete CRM system implementation for enterprise client",
  "expectedCloseDate": "2025-12-31",
  "contactId": "REPLACE_WITH_CONTACT_ID",
  "companyId": "REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID"
}

###
@deal1Id = {{3. Create Deal - Enterprise Software Deal (Acme).response.body.id}}

