### ============================================================
### 6. Get All Deals (Acme tenant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deals
Host: {{acmeSubdomain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

### ============================================================
### 7. Get Deals with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deals?page=1&limit=10
Host: {{acmeSubdomain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

### ============================================================
### 8. Search Deals by Title
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deals?search=Enterprise
Host: {{acmeSubdomain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

### ============================================================
### 9. Filter Deals by Stage - QUALIFIED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deals?stage=QUALIFIED
Host: {{acmeSubdomain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

### ============================================================
