Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

### ============================================================
### 18. Combined Filters - High Priority Deals Over 50k
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deals?priority=HIGH&minValue=50000&sortBy=value&sortOrder=desc
Host: {{acmeSubdomain}}
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

