### ============================================================
### TEST SUMMARY
### ============================================================
### These tests cover:
### 1. CRUD Operations: Create, Read, Update, Delete deals
### 2. Pipeline Stages: LEAD, QUALIFIED, PROPOSAL, NEGOTIATION, CLOSED_WON, CLOSED_LOST
### 3. Stage Transitions: Moving deals through the pipeline
### 4. Pagination: page and limit parameters
### 5. Search: Search by title and description
### 6. Filters:
###    - By stage
###    - By priority
###    - By value range (min/max)
###    - By expected close date range
###    - By owner (current user)
### 7. Sorting: By value, expected close date
### 8. Statistics:
###    - Total deals
###    - Deals by stage
###    - Deals by owner
###    - Total value, won value, lost value, pipeline value
###    - Win rate calculation
###    - Average deal value
###    - Recently added (last 7 days)
###    - Closing soon (next 30 days)
### 9. Tenant Isolation: Acme vs TechStart separation
### 10. Validation: Missing required fields, invalid stages
### 11. Authentication: Token required
### 12. Error Handling: Proper error messages and status codes
###
### Total Test Scenarios: 40
### ============================================================
